---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const description = 'Not by Design connects analytical systems thinking with the human questions explored through PPE and the humanities.';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={description}>
  <article class="prose">
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1>About this publication</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      Not by Design connects ways of thinking that are too often kept apart. Engineering new technologies requires analytical skills for understanding how systems work. The humanities bring attention to human experience, meaning, and moral life. PPE (Philosophy, Politics, and Economics) encourages us to inquire how institutions shape our behavior and how we, in turn, might shape and optimize those institutions.
    </p>

    <p>
      Clear thinking about the world's problems needs a holistic approach: systems thinking, causal and analytical rigor, joined with moral imagination and human understanding. This publication makes room for all three.
    </p>

    <p>
      Ideas here can begin as rough cuts, develop in public, and become releases.
    </p>

    <p>
      The perspective is personal: shaped by deep work in software engineering, technical economics, and doctoral study at George Mason, alongside a lasting love of film criticism and the dream of filmmaking. Not by Design brings those instincts together to understand systems clearly while keeping people in view.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
